# Native CFD photography. Reproduce at 1800x1100 with --scene glider.
workspace fluid
scene glider
quality normal
aoa 9
view speed
cmap hydro
linecmap turbo
surface solid
slice off
volume off
floorgrid off
box off
hud off
streamlines plane
streamlines seeds 120
streamlines width 1.4
streamlines steps 900
streamlines size 0.35 0.8
particles on
particles count 35000
particles size 0.8
particles emitter sheet
vortices off
bloom 0.18
exposure 1.15
camera orbit 30 22
camera zoom 1.25
start
wait 2200
frames 100
screenshot docs/images/showcase-flow-particles.png
particles off
streamlines off
vortices level 25
view vorticity
cmap icefire
frames 30
screenshot docs/images/showcase-flow-vortices.png
status
quit
